00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:31.160
Dia bukan 
orang koma lagi

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:31.840
Iya

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:32.760
Emang kenapa?

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:33.760
Walau dia 

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.480
sudah sadar 

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:35.840
emangnya dia 
punya uang?

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.280
Bahkan mahar saja 
gak sanggup  

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:37.880
Kenapa

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.000
Selia menikah dengannya?

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:39.680
Benar

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.760
Mau menikahi Selia, boleh saja 

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:44.840
tapi ada syaratnya

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:45.960
Suruh Linken itu

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:47.320
siapkan mahar 1,6 miliar

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.920
Kalau gak, lupakan saja

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.760
Benar, minimal 1,6 miliar

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:51.480
1,6 miliar itu

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:52.440
kami harus dapat setengah!

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:53.680
Kalau gak, lupakan saja!

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:54.200
Hmm

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.760
Linken baru saja sadar

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:57.160
mana mungkin 
punya 1,6 miliar? 

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:59.000
Kalian jangan mempersulitnya

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.120
Kalau gitu 
suruh dia pergi

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.560
Aku kenal bos besar

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.880
umurnya baru 50 tahun

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:05.880
kekayaannya 
sudah 20 miliar

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:07.080
Gini saja

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.480
kita kenalkan 
Selia padanya

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:08.920
Benar juga

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:09.640
Selia itu

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.040
walaupun agak tua

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:12.200
tapi penampilannya

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.560
masih lumayan

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:14.240
Masuk akal

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:15.520
Betul

